{
  "version": 1,
  "group": "token",
  "title": "精确 token / 错误码",
  "queries": [
    {
      "id": "tk-001",
      "query": "Error 5001 怎么解决",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "readme.md",
          "quote": "你问「Error 5001 怎么解决」，语义检索觉得「Error 5002」也很像"
        }
      ],
      "note": "README 用它当例子说明向量通道的瞎区。5001/5002 只差一个字符，是这组最典型的一条。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-002",
      "query": "CVE-2026-3172 修的是什么",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "design.md",
          "quote": "修复了 **CVE-2026-3172**"
        }
      ],
      "note": "安全公告编号，必须逐字命中，差一位就是另一条漏洞。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-003",
      "query": "CGO_ENABLED=0 编译会失败吗",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "design.md",
          "quote": "`CGO_ENABLED=0` 的交叉编译直接失败"
        }
      ],
      "note": "环境变量名 + 取值，token 边界靠下划线，模糊匹配很容易跨过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-004",
      "query": "hnsw.ef_search 默认值是多少",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "pitfalls.md",
          "quote": "`hnsw.ef_search` 默认 40 偏低"
        }
      ],
      "note": "带点号的参数名。命中它不仅要 token 对，还要点号没被切碎。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-005",
      "query": "CONTEXTDOCK_SEARCH_TIMEOUT 默认是什么",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "readme.md",
          "quote": "| `CONTEXTDOCK_SEARCH_TIMEOUT` | `5s` | 单次检索超时 |"
        }
      ],
      "note": "长环境变量名。拉丁词整体成 token，向量通道对它几乎没有区分力，纯靠词法。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-006",
      "query": "go: -race requires cgo 怎么解决",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "pitfalls.md",
          "quote": "go: -race requires cgo; enable cgo by setting CGO_ENABLED=1"
        }
      ],
      "note": "拿报错原文当查询——这正是用户真实的求助方式，也是纯词法场景。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-007",
      "query": "20015 错误是什么意思",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "pitfalls.md",
          "quote": "错误码是**参数无效**（20015）"
        }
      ],
      "note": "纯数字错误码。向量通道面对一串数字基本无话可说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-008",
      "query": "truncateRunes 改成按字节截断会怎样",
      "kind": "direct",
      "require_lexical": true,
      "expect": [
        {
          "source": "readme.md",
          "quote": "| `truncateRunes` 改成按字节截断 | `TestTruncateRunesHandlesMultiByte` |"
        }
      ],
      "note": "驼峰函数名。词法通道路径：分词器要把它整体切出来，才可能逐字对上。"
    }
  ]
}
